    <title>宝典：10年恋爱经验全总结，送给想要脱单的你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aef3f50b4a4e20202f64adc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aef3f50b4a4e20202f64adc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoeYI36cjh2ySGk7dIhFmxZr51kL.jpg"><p><span>❤️周一好，会更好！听众朋友们，我们又在周一见面咯～</span></p><p><span>🎙️本期，来到就是赚到，我总结了我过去10年的脱单经验，送给每一位真正想要脱单的姐妹。</span></p><p><span>最先进的大模型你问不到，全网查不到，因为这就是纯纯本人10年摸爬滚打的经验，本期，我将用最不绕弯子，最直白，最blablabla的方式，来告诉你脱单这件事的要点和重难点：</span></p><p><strong><span>「第一阶段：认识人」</span></strong></p><p><span>重难点：我去哪认识人？怎么认识人？</span></p><p><strong><span>「第二阶段：升温期」</span></strong></p><p><span>重难点：聊一次没下文怎么办？约会中有哪些注意事项？</span></p><p><strong><span>「第三阶段：约会节奏」</span></strong></p><p><span>重难点：怎么去层层递进的推动关系？</span></p><p><span>同时，我将把之前发布过一些播客单集放在下方，希望能够帮助到大家：</span></p><p><strong><span>【01：解决你的心魔问题，我到底为什么要谈恋爱？请听⬇️】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6979eae9fed1b9fd8d623a55" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6979eae9fed1b9fd8d623a55"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【02：如果你不会聊天，请听⬇️】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69da9d99b977fb2c47af62ad" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69da9d99b977fb2c47af62ad"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【03：害羞内向，总是不敢主动而错过很多机会？请听⬇️】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ea3f211e94ae6921010514" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ea3f211e94ae6921010514"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【04：不会约会？请听⬇️】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a130a498b5c94538ea376ce" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a130a498b5c94538ea376ce"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【05：焦虑型依恋，如何好好谈恋爱？请听⬇️】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2d0db54233e62bc5491e86" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2d0db54233e62bc5491e86"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【06：遇到回避型依恋的对象，该怎么和ta谈恋爱？请听⬇️】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8f0215ef65145dfcc5ea5e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8f0215ef65145dfcc5ea5e"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【07：关系中怎么和对方谈钱？】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a96d76bf03e74ee6b036b9d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a96d76bf03e74ee6b036b9d"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【08：关系中怎么和对方谈性？】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa58d1b492687f6aad8edcf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa58d1b492687f6aad8edcf"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p><strong><span>【09：如何走出失恋的阴霾？】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b2f09784bce022f92e050a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b2f09784bce022f92e050a"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
